      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiC nanoparticles will be nanoscale and homogeneously dispersed in the matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPS at approximately 950 °C is suitable for producing the proposed TiC-reinforced alloy.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti will react with available carbon during processing to form TiC.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiC nanoparticles will arrest cracks and reduce crack propagation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiC nanoparticles will produce dispersion strengthening by hindering dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6212883::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9744852::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiC reinforcement will increase compressive or yield strength by approximately 30–50% relative to the unreinforced alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6212883::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC9744852::web::005::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The TiC addition will not significantly interfere with the magneto-structural phase transition.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy's large caloric response will be preserved under applied magnetic-field operation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy's large caloric response will be preserved under pressure-field operation.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
